    "detailed_description": "Welcome to the reality of Polish life, where everyday routines revolve around open conflicts with your neighbor, scheming, grilling, and finding ways to make your life easier\u2014or making someone else's harder.<br><br>Each task in the game can be solved in multiple ways. It's up to you whether you go for quick and obvious solutions or come up with something more elaborate. Some methods will be apparent right away, but the most effective ones often require a bit of creativity to discover.<br><br>In Polish reality, it\u2019s not about working hard but working smart! Save your time and energy\u2014you might need them for other activities unless, of course, you get caught...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447730/extras/5ed7fde9d6f8d60978f7b105c2ee26d6.poster.avif?t=1753171434\" width=600 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447730/extras/5ed7fde9d6f8d60978f7b105c2ee26d6.webm?t=1753171434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447730/extras/5ed7fde9d6f8d60978f7b105c2ee26d6.mp4?t=1753171434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>No true Pole skips a barbecue, and neither will you. Dive into various activities, like competing in a drinking duel\u2014you've got to show your brother-in-law how it\u2019s done, after all.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447730/extras/4c368e97a68d45c535971ad15a9fbc7f.poster.avif?t=1753171434\" width=600 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447730/extras/4c368e97a68d45c535971ad15a9fbc7f.webm?t=1753171434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447730/extras/4c368e97a68d45c535971ad15a9fbc7f.mp4?t=1753171434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Life is a constant race for the best deals. Keep an eye on promotions, hunt for discounts, and grab the last items on the shelf before anyone else does. Remember, every zloty you save is one less for your nosy neighbor.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447730/extras/91e920b41e134e3a437b9d077090f0aa.poster.avif?t=1753171434\" width=600 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447730/extras/91e920b41e134e3a437b9d077090f0aa.webm?t=1753171434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447730/extras/91e920b41e134e3a437b9d077090f0aa.mp4?t=1753171434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In this game, cleverness and creativity are your greatest weapons. Find unconventional solutions to the challenges ahead and show your neighbor who\u2019s the real boss around here!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447730/extras/f74daa1f549e5f88aff3f77c91e96b26.poster.avif?t=1753171434\" width=600 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447730/extras/f74daa1f549e5f88aff3f77c91e96b26.webm?t=1753171434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447730/extras/f74daa1f549e5f88aff3f77c91e96b26.mp4?t=1753171434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
